# NOTE: docs/ui-atlas/*.jpg and docs/ui-states/*.jpg ARE tracked, deliberately. They are the
# reviewable record of what every screen and every modal state actually looked like, kept as JPEG
# for that reason. Regenerate with:
#   cd frontend && node scripts/capture-ui-atlas.mjs && node scripts/drive-ui-states.mjs
#                  && node scripts/build-ui-contact-sheets.mjs
